MID_Access_Goto_MiddleLayer: 前往韃古席翁 中層
MID_Access_Goto_UnderLayer: 前往韃古席翁 下層
MID_Access_Goto_Gmap: 離開韃古席翁
MID_Access_Goto_Throne: 前往賽爾西沃的房間
